work right?

>> whereas the ssc devices are properly (as in 2.6.28) initialized
>> ssc ssc.0: Atmel SSC device at 0xffe1c00 (irq 10)
>> ssc ssc.1: Atmel SSC device at 0xffe2000 (irq 11)
